f[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]An agent's in-agent handoff (above all `sase monitor start`) either[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]completes or fails loudly. Codex turns can no longer end while a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]handoff command is still running, monitor starts are fast and never[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]silent, and a killed handoff is recorded and surfaced instead of [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]leaving an assigned bead stuck in_progress.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]codex_monitor_handoff_cutoff.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/codex_monitor_handoff_cutoff.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-18e[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-18e/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Codex adapter conformance for handoff commands[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]codex-handoff-guard[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]codex-handoff-guard: count only the final answer in the Codex [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]turn-integrity signal, classify SASE handoff commands, replace the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]silent pass with a bounded continuation that re-drives a stranded [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]handoff, state Codex's real exec-yield ceiling in a single-turn [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]directive, and clarify the monitor and final skill wording.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make in-agent sase monitor start fast and never silent[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]fast-monitor-start[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]fast-monitor-start: resolve a pinned caller without a full project scan,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]do one lane-scoped monitor read per start (adding an index filter in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sase-core if needed), add start timing, and print a stderr line before [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]any slow work.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Host records and surfaces a killed handoff[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]aborted-handoff-evidence[dim] · [dim][/dim]after fast-monitor-start[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]aborted-handoff-evidence: write an in-flight marker from in-agent [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]handoff commands, have the runner adopt a late handoff or record [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]handoff_aborted, write accurate recovery evidence, and notify the user [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]when a handoff was killed.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-18e","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-sol","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","reasoning_effort":"high","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","wait_for_beads":["sase-18e.1","sase-18e.2","sase-18e.3"],"workflow_name":"sase-18e.land"},"source_run_id":"run-4d34d0ebda5ddf557fb5b342369632aa","started_at":"2026-09-24T23:20:24.137330+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1790284233,"sha":"6a9bac885fb61920d213dabe246f0b06352428b7","subject":"fix(codex): recover stranded handoff commands"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"ab2da265c05e03b96fdf8cf7c2cbe53a003d3e764a5cb5f3aa4d20383546951f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-18e.1/chat.md","size_bytes":5930},"commits":{"digest":"5d1184361b88eb4c443d9aff765e71568b1574d1d1fd49265c2da49c29e4007a","path":"agen